Z||000004||Standard||08-26-2000||05:24 AM||||Yeah that guy's been smokin' a little too much of something... all the Fiero v6's were chevy <B>made</B> and pontiac <B>tuned</B>.<P>I'd steer clear of that one.. he sounds a bit shady...<P>------------------<BR>Mike -<BR>Black 86.5 GT 5 Spd, 149,000 miles and counting!      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/BURNOUT.gif">   <BR>Red 84 Sport Coupe - winter donut maker||||reg||1
